Attribution

The factual content, study citations, treatment summaries, and clinical
framings in this repository are derived from the public ME/CFS + Long COVID
resource document maintained by Sarah Healing (@sarahhhhealing on Instagram),
a medical student documenting research while ill. This repository only
contributes the graph-structured restructuring: splitting content into
interlinked notes, tagging, and rendering connections.

Original source: Sarah Healing's public Google Doc (captured 2026-05-28).

When using or adapting this work, please credit both:
  - Sarah Healing (original content)
  - This repository (graph structuring and tagging)

